# Symbian^3 (N8 RM-596 011.012 EUser.dll) executive call numbering -> our kernel.
# Our own numbering (the user side was built from the same exec table: every call identified by
# export has our number, probe.py stubs), except the one argument convention that differs:
# RMutex::Wait() passes no timeout (r1 undefined; our EUSER passes 0), so S11 goes through the 9.2 shim.
# Identity part generated from kernel/eka/kernel/execs.txt; S11 manual. Format: personalities/sym92/exec.map.
